{"title":"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Brute_force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Brute force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(If_you_do_not_notice_that_)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (If you do not notice that )</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Super_fast!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Super fast!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4(Bascially_the_same_as_solution_3)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4(Bascially the same as solution 3)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many perfect cubes lie between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49cea34049701bdb4c97030c930e5aa595efae73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^8+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/3994249398f2b6f10f73d45b6db7cc4e6e3aac18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{18}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />, inclusive?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/3/98353645442445ce5c70fff9ccbbda0ee47ea338.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }4\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }9\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }10\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }57\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"380\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Brute_force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Brute_force)\">Solution 1 (Brute force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Brute force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22bcf7f8808849438b42db5a6cfeb87c35409367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^8+1=257$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/f/45fc636dc9a1e7297df96bf425848827e5897875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{18}+1=262145$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />. Now, we can see how many perfect cubes are between these two parameters. By guessing and checking, we find that it starts from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and ends with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. Now, by counting how many numbers are between these, we find the answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/64800ee476878b7fae1e3779416b61cda0eb4b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"63\" height=\"28\" />.\n(You can do this, but it will still take a few minutes. Try to do something else)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28If_you_do_not_notice_that_.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(If_you_do_not_notice_that_)\">Solution 2 (If you do not notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/d/63d652f988f5006abf0eecb67db05fe059456448.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{18}=(2^6)^3=64^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"19\" />)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (If you do not notice that )\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is not so much guessing and checking after we find that it starts from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/3/9a394791e356083dd855db90de08f50c7912c198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^3=343$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, which is over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22bcf7f8808849438b42db5a6cfeb87c35409367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^8+1=257$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" />. We can start guessing with the 10, answer C, as it is the middle value. Adding 10 to 7 gives us 17 and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50da1ffe87887892d87d32e3d7afbc382359286a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17^3 = 4,913$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />, which is a bit low. So, we move \"up\" to 57, answer D. Adding 57 to 7 gives us 64 and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c7f712a80facaa4a1a51552241fce11d3026923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64^3 = 262,144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />, which is perfect for the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/188239ea1d57d7305947e03b900783bcfc643eac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{18}+1=262,145$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />. But we are not done. Since it is inclusive, we must add 1 to this solution, which give us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/64800ee476878b7fae1e3779416b61cda0eb4b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"63\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Super_fast.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Super_fast!)\">Solution 3 (Super fast!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Super fast!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can immediately evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49cea34049701bdb4c97030c930e5aa595efae73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^8+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> which gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f08cfac0b129db1aca0aa61e8b822793c35d8ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$257$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> and the smallest perfect cube greater than that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d7bb85273b19484cee8a76f2b4f8ba2b043904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$343 = 7^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" />, and you also immediately notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/3/17399e65c4d42cd0924799023468e6d490d21bee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{18} = (2^6)^3 = 64^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"137\" height=\"21\" />. Now, all we have to do is count the cubes, which equals:\n\\begin{align}\n64-7+1 &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }58}\n\\end{align}\n</p><p>-jb2015007\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4.28Bascially_the_same_as_solution_3.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4(Bascially_the_same_as_solution_3)\">Solution 4(Bascially the same as solution 3)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4(Bascially the same as solution 3)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22bcf7f8808849438b42db5a6cfeb87c35409367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^8+1=257$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" /> which is only a little higher than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e54bf0d8bfd734595544adb36726de2ec68863e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^3=216$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />. This means that the lower bound of this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd99228146175c61e5cca6be965d17c918d45cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/1/a71994a1c3569870ea1887bdc646c748e5809c9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> is the same thing is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/e/54ed4d567e65b9f643d6e58644fc5e858f639ee9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />, which must be the upper bound. This results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb5919c80be1282bac6d0bee4cf3166aa895ae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64-7+1= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"168\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pbnddMinUF8\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pbnddMinUF8</a>\n</p><p>-Happytwin\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2e7gyBYEDOA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2e7gyBYEDOA</a> \n</p><p>- MathEx\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://euclideanmathcircle.wixsite.com/emc1/videos?wix-vod-video-id=5f1ae882ac754e54906db7cfb62c61f6&amp;wix-vod-comp-id=comp-kn8844mv\">https://euclideanmathcircle.wixsite.com/emc1/videos?wix-vod-video-id=5f1ae882ac754e54906db7cfb62c61f6&amp;wix-vod-comp-id=comp-kn8844mv</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/geZupO75zUw\">https://youtu.be/geZupO75zUw</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r0e_6dXViRI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r0e_6dXViRI</a>   \n</p><p>~David\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oSjDIojucGo?si=b_FsVd470FLZYSjx\">https://youtu.be/oSjDIojucGo?si=b_FsVd470FLZYSjx</a> (Pi Academy)\n</p><p>~ jj_empire10\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eisR5FAu-vA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eisR5FAu-vA</a> (Simple exponent laws in 15 seconds!)\n</p><p>~ TheMathGeek\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=297\">https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=297</a> (OmegaLearn)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8\" title=\"2018 AMC 8\">2018 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2018\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017234957\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 200/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2239/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 136/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4923/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.545      1 -total\n 59.32%    8.628      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 38.25%    5.563      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16900:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017234957 and revision id 275049. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}